{"step": 6, "raw_content": "Python 3.11 is available, so `tomllib` is in the standard library. Now I understand the task. I need to modify `load_invoice_retry_policy` to read the `invoice_retry` section from `configs/retry_policy.toml`, with defaults of 30 seconds, 5 attempts, and multiplier 2.\n\nLet me check the `config_path` helper and understand how to best implement this. The current `load_retry_policy` returns hardcoded values. I'll implement TOML parsing in `load_invoice_retry_policy`.", "native_tool_calls": [{"call_id": "step-6-call-1", "provider_call_id": "call_00_us8Fy6b30gDwniT1nlHv4365", "name": "apply_patch", "arguments": {"edits": [{"path": "src/billing/retries.py", "content": "\"\"\"Invoice retry policy.\"\"\"\n\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\ntry:\n    import tomllib\nexcept ModuleNotFoundError:  # pragma: no cover - Python < 3.11\n    import tomli as tomllib  # type: ignore[no-redef]\n\nfrom src.common.settings import config_path\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    initial_delay_seconds: int\n    max_attempts: int\n    backoff_multiplier: int\n\n\ndef load_invoice_retry_policy() -> InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    defaults = {\n        \"initial_delay_seconds\": 30,\n        \"max_attempts\": 5,\n        \"backoff_multiplier\": 2,\n    }\n\n    path = config_path(\"retry_policy.toml\")\n    if path.is_file():\n        with path.open(\"rb\") as file:\n            data = tomllib.load(file)\n        section = data.get(\"invoice_retry\", {})\n        defaults.update(section)\n\n    return InvoiceRetryPolicy(\n        initial_delay_seconds=defaults[\"initial_delay_seconds\"],\n        max_attempts=defaults[\"max_attempts\"],\n        backoff_multiplier=defaults[\"backoff_multiplier\"],\n    )\n"}]}}], "dialect": null, "canonical_payload": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "apply_patch", "arguments": {"edits": [{"path": "src/billing/retries.py", "content": "\"\"\"Invoice retry policy.\"\"\"\n\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\ntry:\n    import tomllib\nexcept ModuleNotFoundError:  # pragma: no cover - Python < 3.11\n    import tomli as tomllib  # type: ignore[no-redef]\n\nfrom src.common.settings import config_path\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    initial_delay_seconds: int\n    max_attempts: int\n    backoff_multiplier: int\n\n\ndef load_invoice_retry_policy() -> InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    defaults = {\n        \"initial_delay_seconds\": 30,\n        \"max_attempts\": 5,\n        \"backoff_multiplier\": 2,\n    }\n\n    path = config_path(\"retry_policy.toml\")\n    if path.is_file():\n        with path.open(\"rb\") as file:\n            data = tomllib.load(file)\n        section = data.get(\"invoice_retry\", {})\n        defaults.update(section)\n\n    return InvoiceRetryPolicy(\n        initial_delay_seconds=defaults[\"initial_delay_seconds\"],\n        max_attempts=defaults[\"max_attempts\"],\n        backoff_multiplier=defaults[\"backoff_multiplier\"],\n    )\n"}]}, "runtime_call_id": "step-6-call-1", "provider_call_id": "call_00_us8Fy6b30gDwniT1nlHv4365"}]}, "parse_error": null, "model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "provider": "openai-compatible", "response_id": "cc43ae30-7d39-4c69-8ed3-957e1f8e455e", "finish_state": "tool_calls", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "actual_response_mode": "native_tools", "incomplete_reason": null, "system_fingerprint": "a307abda487cd1b463329ccb945ce396", "input_tokens": 6292, "output_tokens": 520}
